    "plugin": {
      "description": "Customized version of Visibility plugin.\n\nAllows you to hide players, pets, chocobos and minions.\nIncludes VoidList, which is a better blacklist.\nAccessible via /pvis\nMore information available via /xlhelp",
      "images": [
